  You don't need zoi quotes for lojban.  That's for making a foreign phrase
into a lojban quotation.  What you probably meant was "la'o zoi Welcome to
Night Vale zoi" If you really meant to translate something FROM the lojban,
then  "la'e lu  fi'i ko zvati la nicte ma'arbi'i li'u " would have been the
way to go.

         --gejyspa



